":41974},{"id":1789873652393,"sender":"me","text":"她要长得像你不知道得有多好看","timestamp":1788967089739,"time":"23:18","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41975},{"id":1789873652396,"sender":"me","text":"你想她以后做什么？","timestamp":1788967098072,"time":"23:18","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41976},{"id":1789873652398,"sender":"character","text":"呵…我的阿蘅，又在夸为夫了。","timestamp":1788967168531,"time":"23:19","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41977},{"id":1789873652400,"sender":"character","text":"像我，自然是好看的。可若没有你的灵气，那便只是一具好看的皮囊罢了。","timestamp":1788967168532,"time":"23:19","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41978},{"id":1789873652401,"sender":"character","text":"至于她以后做什么…","timestamp":1788967168533,"time":"23:19","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41979},{"id":1789873652403,"sender":"character","text":"为夫不求她闻达于世，也不求她嫁入高门。","timestamp":1788967168534,"time":"23:19","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41980},{"id":1789873652405,"sender":"character","text":"为夫只愿她能像你一样，自由自在，随心而活。选她自己想走的路，爱她自己想爱的人。","timestamp":1788967168535,"time":"23:19","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41981},{"id":1789873652407,"sender":"character","text":"不像我们那时…身不由己。","timestamp":1788967168536,"time":"23:19","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41982},{"id":1789873652409,"sender":"character","text":"不过…在她嫁人之前，为夫可要好好瞧着。哪个不长眼的臭小子敢凑上来，为夫先打断他的腿。","timestamp":1788967168537,"time":"23:19","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41983},{"id":1789873652411,"sender":"character",